#: man-kqml.1.docbook:13
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "kqml User's Manual"
msgstr "kqml उपयोगकर्ता पुस्तिका"

#: man-kqml.1.docbook:14
#. Tag: date
#, no-c-format
msgid "2023-06-10"
msgstr "२०२३-०६-१०"

#: man-kqml.1.docbook:15
#. Tag: releaseinfo
#, no-c-format
msgid "Plasma 6.0"
msgstr "प्लाज्मा ६.०"

#: man-kqml.1.docbook:16
#. Tag: productname
#, no-c-format
msgid "KDE Plasma"
msgstr "केडीई प्लाज्मा"

#: man-kqml.1.docbook:21
#. Tag: manvolnum
#, no-c-format
msgid "<manvolnum>1</manvolnum>"
msgstr "<मन्वोल्नुम्>१</मन्वोल्नुम्>"

#: man-kqml.1.docbook:26
#. Tag: refpurpose
#, no-c-format
msgid "QML Runtime with KLocalizedContext"
msgstr "KLocalizedContext इत्यनेन सह QML Runtime"

#: man-kqml.1.docbook:30
#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>kqml</command> <group choice=\"opt\"><option>-v, "
"--version</option></group> <group choice=\"opt\"><option>-h, "
"--help</option></group> <group choice=\"opt\"><option>-d, --domain</option> "
"<replaceable>domain</replaceable></group> <arg "
"choice=\"opt\"><replaceable>files</replaceable>...</arg> <arg "
"choice=\"opt\"><option>--</option> <replaceable>args</replaceable>...</arg>"
msgstr ""
"<command>kqml</command><group choice=\"opt\"><option value=\"-v, "
"--version\"> -व, --संस्करणम्</option></group><group choice=\"opt\"><option "
"value=\"-h, --help\"> -ह, --सहाय</option></group><group "
"choice=\"opt\"><option value=\"-d, --domain\"> -d, --domain "
"इति</option><replaceable> क्षेत्र</replaceable></group><arg "
"choice=\"opt\"><replaceable> सञ्चिकाः</replaceable> ...</arg><arg "
"choice=\"opt\"><option value=--> -- ९.</option><replaceable> "
"अर्ग्स्</replaceable> ...</arg>"

#: man-kqml.1.docbook:42
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "वर्णनम्‌"

#: man-kqml.1.docbook:43
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>kqml</command> is a QML runtime with initialized KLocalizedContext."
msgstr ""
"<command>kqml</command> इति प्रारम्भित KLocalizedContext इत्यनेन सह QML "
"रनटाइम् अस्ति ।"

#: man-kqml.1.docbook:45
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Unlike the qml tool that comes with qt-declarative package, kqml "
"initializes KLocalizedContext that allows testing real-world applications "
"and scratch files with i18n calls throughout their code and imported "
"libraries."
msgstr ""
"qt-declarative संकुलेन सह आगच्छति qml साधनस्य विपरीतम्, kqml "
"KLocalizedContext इत्यस्य आरम्भं करोति यत् वास्तविक-दुनिया-अनुप्रयोगानाम् "
"परीक्षणं कर्तुं शक्नोति तथा च i18n-आह्वानैः सह स्क्रैच-सञ्चिकाः तेषां "
"सम्पूर्णे कोड्-मध्ये आयातित-पुस्तकालयेषु च अनुमन्यते"

#: man-kqml.1.docbook:51
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Options"
msgstr "विकल्पाः"

#: man-kqml.1.docbook:55
#. Tag: term
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>-v</option>, <option>--version</option>"
msgstr ""
"<option value=-v>-वि</option> , ९.<option value=--version> "
"--संस्करण</option>"

#: man-kqml.1.docbook:56
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Displays version information."
msgstr "संस्करणसूचनाः प्रदर्शयति ।"

#: man-kqml.1.docbook:59
#. Tag: term
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<option>-d</option>, <option>--domain</option> "
"<replaceable>domain</replaceable>"
msgstr ""
"<option value=-d>-घ</option> , ९.<option value=--domain> "
"--क्षेत्र</option><replaceable> क्षेत्र</replaceable>"

#: man-kqml.1.docbook:60
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "The main localization domain."
msgstr "मुख्यं स्थानीयकरणक्षेत्रम् ।"

#: man-kqml.1.docbook:63
#. Tag: term
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>-h</option>, <option>--help</option>"
msgstr "<option value=-h>-ह</option> , ९.<option value=--help> --साहाय्यम्‌</option>"

#: man-kqml.1.docbook:64
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Displays this help."
msgstr "एतत् साहाय्यं प्रदर्शयति ।"

#: man-kqml.1.docbook:67
#. Tag: term
#, no-c-format
msgid "<replaceable>files</replaceable>..."
msgstr "<replaceable>सञ्चिकाः</replaceable>..."

#: man-kqml.1.docbook:68
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Any number of QML files can be loaded. They will share the same engine."
msgstr ""
"यत्किमपि संख्यायां QML सञ्चिकाः लोड् कर्तुं शक्यन्ते । ते समानं इञ्जिनं "
"साझां करिष्यन्ति।"

#: man-kqml.1.docbook:72
#. Tag: term
#, no-c-format
msgid "<replaceable>args</replaceable>..."
msgstr "<प्रतिस्थापनीय>अर्ग्स्</प्रतिस्थापनीय>..."

#: man-kqml.1.docbook:73
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Arguments after '<option>--</option>' are ignored, but passed through to "
"the application.arguments variable in QML."
msgstr ""
"&#39; .&#39; परं तर्काः ।<option value=--> -- ९.</option> &#39; इत्यस्य "
"अवहेलना भवति, परन्तु QML मध्ये application.arguments चरपर्यन्तं पारितं भवति "
"।"

#: man-kqml.1.docbook:82
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "See Also"
msgstr "इदमपि पश्यन्तु"

#: man-kqml.1.docbook:84
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"More detailed user documentation is available from <ulink "
"url=\"help:/plasma-desktop\">help:/plasma-desktop</ulink> (either enter "
"this <acronym>URL</acronym> into &konqueror;, or run "
"<userinput><command>khelpcenter</command> "
"<parameter>help:/plasma-desktop</parameter></userinput>)."
msgstr ""
"अधिकविस्तृतं उपयोक्तृदस्तावेजं <ulink "
"url=\"help:/plasma-desktop\">help:/plasma-desktop</ulink> इत्यस्मात् "
"उपलभ्यते (एतत् <acronym>URL</acronym> इत्येतत् &konqueror; इत्यत्र "
"प्रविशन्तु, अथवा <userinput चालयन्तु ><command>khelpcenter</command> "
"<parameter>सहाय्यम्:/प्लाज्मा-डेस्कटॉप</parameter></userinput>) इति ।"

#: man-kqml.1.docbook:93
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Authors"
msgstr "लेखकाः"

